        "original_id": "91806faf-10fa-5197-9259-c4f3bf229c4c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Cheyenne Warrior, Battlefield Earth, Sky High\n- People: Michael B. Druxman, Mark Griffiths, Kelly Preston, Dan Haggerty, Pato Hoffmann, John Travolta, Michael Angarano, Danielle Panabaker, Kurt Russell, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Steven Strait, Lynda Carter\n- Topics: American Civil War\n\nFacts:\n- Cheyenne Warrior is a 1994 American film written by Michael B. Druxman, directed by Mark Griffiths, and starring Kelly Preston, Dan Haggerty, and Pato Hoffmann.\n- Cheyenne Warrior follows a widowed, pregnant woman stranded at a trading post during the American Civil War.\n- Kelly Preston was married to John Travolta, and they collaborated on the fantasy film Battlefield Earth.\n- Sky High is a 2005 film starring Michael Angarano as Will, Danielle Panabaker as his best friend and love interest, Kurt Russell and Kelly Preston as his parents, Mary Elizabeth Winstead as a popular senior, Steven Strait as Will's rival, and Lynda Carter as Principal Powers.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
